  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - Gaza - Water, Sanitation and Hygiene</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2025, UNRWA will increase access to water for displaced and returning populations by maintaining desalination systems, wells, and water trucking through fuel provision, and where needed, supplying bottled water. The Agency will also construct wells with desalination units. To address environmental health risks in overcrowded conditions, UNRWA will distribute family hygiene kits, install toilet and sanitation units, provide cleaning supplies, and promote hygiene at its shelters. It will continue to lead solid waste collection and vector control services across Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
